<!--Post: 2883--><!--Time: 1104227526-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2883"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 28, 2004 - 1:52 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Great to hear you&#39;re getting out soon.  I loved seeing that you&#39;re into the Lord and bikes - those are definitely two of my favorite things, too.  Someday my bike will make it back to Kansas, and when it does, maybe we&#39;ll ride.  Stay strong with the Lord and safe on the road, brother!  There&#39;s a lot of folks out here pulling for you. <BR> <BR>Ride free! <BR> <BR>-pax56<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2883-->
<!--Post: 2892--><!--Time: 1104239913-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2892"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tim<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tim<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 28, 2004 - 5:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dear Charlie, <BR> <BR>all the best for 2005! Greetings Tim &#40;from Amsterdam, Holland&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2892-->
<!--Post: 2893--><!--Time: 1104241097-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2893"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 28, 2004 - 5:38 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Charlie O, I feel sorry that your life was torn apart by this tragedy. But that was the past. You must look to the future and think positive! Don&#39;t worry. This case has to be solved, because God is Just and people are praying for justice. Be strong. Good luck in the New Year. <BR>Take care, <BR>Deb <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2893-->
<!--Post: 2898--><!--Time: 1104249391-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2898"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Affie4u<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Affie4u<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 28, 2004 - 7:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dear Charlie, <BR> <BR>All the Best to you . <BR> <BR>Take care of yourself. <BR> <BR>-K<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2898-->
<!--Post: 2904--><!--Time: 1104253385-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2904"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:dammitslicky@cox.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 28, 2004 - 9:03 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hello, Charlie.  <BR> <BR>You&#39;ve had a rough time of it for sure. Many of us here in Wichita pray for you and wish you well. I look forward to your release from NM corrections, and hopefully, a better, happier future for yourself and your family.  <BR> <BR>All the best, <BR> <BR>Cougar<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2904-->
<!--Post: 2931--><!--Time: 1104285432-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2931"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 28, 2004 - 5:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey, Charlie! <BR> <BR>It&#39;s a big, beautiful county we live in and you have many things to offer, with decency and an eye toward the future. Strength! <BR> <BR>George <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2931-->
<!--Post: 2938--><!--Time: 1104294260-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2938"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:littledaisymae2003@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->???<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 28, 2004 - 8:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Good Luck Charlie.  Many people are praying for you.  The number of good people in the world far out weighs the one who destroyed your family.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2938-->
<!--Post: 2939--><!--Time: 1104300608-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2939"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 28, 2004 - 10:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Charlie, <BR> It must be hard to understand how God can love us but such horrible things happen. <BR> <BR>God&#39;s son was murdered as well. Although he went willingly for a reason he was innocent and suffered a horrible and humiliating death. <BR> <BR>Perhaps the enemies of God would like you to reject God because of what man does and has done... the beauty of your life and ultimately your Eternal life lies in Christ and all the lies in this lost and dying world can&#39;t change that. <BR> <BR>Why turn to Jesus when the world is lost and dying... the answer is simple... we have a eternal life as well and he wants us to share the Gospel &#34;Good News&#34; with the lost. <BR> <BR>There are many in the Bible that suffered unjustly and for Jesus Christ&#39;s sake as well... perhaps these testimonies can comfort and strengthen you when the enemy will tell you otherwise. <BR> <BR>I&#39;m praying for you Charlie. <BR> <BR>Here is a link to a web site that has plenty of free resources and you can watch and/or listen to everyday folks talk about there faith or lack of it. Humor is thru out but the message is clear. <BR> <BR>I recommend &#34;God&#39;s Wonderful Plan&#34; &#40;not what you think&#41; &#34;The Firefighter&#34; &amp; of course HBKS &amp; True &amp; False <BR> <BR>Here is the link: <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.livingwaters.com/watch.shtml" target=_top>http://www.livingwaters.com/watch.shtml</a> <BR> <BR>&#42;&#42;&#42;&#42;&#42; <BR> <BR>Thanks Tom for the opportunity to speak to Charlie. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2939-->
<!--Post: 3058--><!--Time: 1104394526-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3058"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Glad<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Glad<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 30, 2004 - 12:15 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dear Charlie, <BR> <BR>My thoughts and prayers are with you. As you come out of prison, may Gods grace and comfort be with you.  May you experience new beginnings, reconciliations and complete forgiveness.  May you be set free from any lingering bitterness which anyone could understand after what you sufferered.  You have a destiny yet to fulfill.  Be strong in the Lord, enjoy your freedom and be busy working in the kingdom.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3058-->
<!--Post: 3090--><!--Time: 1104446276-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3090"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->JLC<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 30, 2004 - 2:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Good luck Charlie. There&#39;s millions of people out there that care about you and hope the best for you when you come out. <BR> <BR> <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3090-->
<!--Post: 3114--><!--Time: 1104464346-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3114"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:mikesicq@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->MWI<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 30, 2004 - 7:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Charlie, <BR>I am so sorry as to what happened to you that awful day in 1974!  I wish you ONLY the best of luck with your future!!! <BR> <BR>Also, Charlie, don&#39;t give up on your crusade to find this creep that took so much away from you!  I think you are the one that will finally find this guy if you really set your mind to it.   <BR> <BR>GOOD LUCK!!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3114-->
<!--Post: 3116--><!--Time: 1104467321-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3116"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Screamer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Screamer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 30, 2004 - 8:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Charlie, <BR> <BR>My prayers are with you. Hope this message finds you well. <BR> <BR>I remember that day that changed your life. My grandmother lived directly behind you at the time. It was terrible what happened. <BR> <BR>Since that day, I pray that there will be closure for you. <BR> <BR>Regards.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3116-->
<!--Post: 3368--><!--Time: 1104835823-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3368"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nugzter<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 04, 2005 - 2:50 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dear Charlie, <BR>Wish you all the best in the New Year from good ol&#39; Germany. Take care of your self.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3368-->
<!--Post: 3407--><!--Time: 1104880354-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3407"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 04, 2005 - 3:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Charlie <BR> <BR>You are in my prayers and I wish that life will be god to you and that you in time will find true love and peace. <BR> <BR>May I ask you if your father owned a funny Zippo lighter? <BR> <BR>skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3407-->
<!--Post: 3420--><!--Time: 1104885233-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3420"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Researcher<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Researcher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 04, 2005 - 4:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Charlie, <BR> <BR>I am aware of the reasons for your incarceration.  However, even with a series of violations, one CAN make a fresh start.  It is my hope - prayer - that you will be able to overcome the weakness that has caused you to loose your freedom in the past.  What is done is done.  What is yet to be begins now. <BR> <BR>I want you to use and develop your talents to the best of your ability and also want you to know that many people are thinking positive for you AND praying for you. <BR> <BR>There is an Internet community that is counting on YOU and backing you from here on out.  Make the best of it. Never repeat the past. Never give up on the future.  You have many friends willing to encourage and assist you. <BR> <BR>Researcher<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3420-->
<!--Post: 3451--><!--Time: 1104929972-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3451"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lynette795<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lynette795<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 05, 2005 - 4:59 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Charlie,                                       <BR>It&#39;s Lynette.  Will you please call Joseph, he is worried about you, since the phone card ran out of time.  We would like to see if you want to get transfered to a location near us.  I think it would be cool if you and he could go to college together.  He really is excited that you two were able to talk the other night.  Joseph wants to send you a phone card, so that you can call him, let us know where to send it.  I hope we can talk again soon!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
